{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/audio/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/audio/", "title": "Audio Filters", "content_html": "<p>The MiSTer has audio filters that make the audio sound less harsh and more balanced. Some old game systems were not designed for raw digital output: they had...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/audio.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:34:03+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/console/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/console/", "title": "Linux Serial Console", "content_html": "<p>The DE10-Nano board has a console port. It lets you log in to Linux without a network connection and provides debug/info output that is sometimes useful for ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/console.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:34:03+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/case/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/case/", "title": "Cases", "content_html": "<p>There are many MiSTer FPGA cases to choose from: DIY project-box builds, retro-fitted old computer or console injection molded cases, 3D-printed designs, and...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/case.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:34:03+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "title": "Controllers", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer supports a wide variety of input devices. It also offers options for configuring them and several quality-of-life features that work in most (sometime...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/input.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:34:03+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/audio/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/audio/", "title": "\u30aa\u30fc\u30c7\u30a3\u30aa\u30d5\u30a3\u30eb\u30bf\u30fc", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306e\u30aa\u30fc\u30c7\u30a3\u30aa\u30d5\u30a3\u30eb\u30bf\u30fc\u306f\u3001\u97f3\u306e\u304d\u3064\u3055\u3092\u548c\u3089\u3052\u30d0\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u826f\u304f\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u53e4\u3044\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u306e\u4e2d\u306b\u306f\u3001\u751f\u306e\u30c7\u30b8\u30bf\u30eb\u51fa\u529b\u3092\u60f3\u5b9a\u3057\u3066\u3044\u306a\u3044\u3082\u306e\u304c\u3042\u308a\u3001\u97f3\u58f0\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u3068\u30b9\u30d4\u30fc\u30ab\u30fc\u306e\u9593\u306b\u30a2\u30ca\u30ed\u30b0\u30aa\u30fc\u30c7\u30a3\u30aa\u30d5\u30a3\u30eb\u30bf\u30fc\u304c\u5165\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u3053\u308c\u3089\u306e\u30d5\u30a3\u30eb\u30bf\u30fc\u306f\u3001\u5b9f\u969b\u306e\u96fb\u5b50\u56de\u8def\u3067\u4f7f\u308f\u308c\u308b\u4e00\u822c\u7684\u306a\u30d5\u30a3\u30eb\u30bf\u30fc\u3092\u8868\u3059\u6570\u5f0f\u304b\u3089\u751f\u6210\u3055...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/audio.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:34:03+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/console/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/console/", "title": "Linux\u30b7\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb", "content_html": "<p>DE10-Nano \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u306f\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u63a5\u7d9a\u306a\u3057\u3067 Linux \u306b\u30ed\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\u3067\u304d\u3001\u554f\u984c\u306e\u8ffd\u8de1\u306b\u5f79\u7acb\u3064\u30c7\u30d0\u30c3\u30b0\uff0f\u60c5\u5831\u51fa\u529b\u3082\u5f97\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u4e0b\u306e\u5199\u771f\u3067\u3001\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u53f3\u5074\u306e <strong>UART-to-USB\uff08USB Mini-B\uff09</strong> \u30b3\u30cd\u30af\u30bf\u30fc\u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\uff1a</p>\n<p>![UART port locat...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/console.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:34:03+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/case/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/case/", "title": "\u30b1\u30fc\u30b9", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer FPGA \u306e\u30b1\u30fc\u30b9\u306f\u9078\u629e\u80a2\u304c\u8c4a\u5bcc\u3067\u3059\u3002DIY \u306e\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u30dc\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u3001\u53e4\u3044\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u3084\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u6a5f\u306e\u5c04\u51fa\u6210\u5f62\u30b1\u30fc\u30b9\u3092\u6d41\u7528\u3057\u305f\u3082\u306e\u30013D \u30d7\u30ea\u30f3\u30c8\u54c1\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30df\u524a\u308a\u51fa\u3057\u30d2\u30fc\u30c8\u30b7\u30f3\u30af\u30b1\u30fc\u30b9\u306a\u3069\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30a2\u30a4\u30c7\u30a2\u3092\u96c6\u3081\u308b</h2>\n<p>\u81ea\u5206\u3067\u30b1\u30fc\u30b9\u3092\u4f5c\u308a\u305f\u3044\u306a\u3089\u3001\u516c\u5f0f MiSTer FPGA \u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30e9\u30e0\u306e [\"Show...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/case.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:34:03+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/input/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/input/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f\u591a\u7a2e\u591a\u69d8\u306a\u5165\u529b\u6a5f\u5668\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3084\u3001\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306e\uff08\u5834\u5408\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u306f\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\uff09\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\u4fbf\u5229\u6a5f\u80fd\u3082\u5099\u3048\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u30b9\u30d4\u30ca\u30fc\u30fb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30d1\u30c3\u30c9\u30fb\u30b8\u30e7\u30a4\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30c3\u30af\u30fb\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306a\u3069\u306e\u6a5f\u5668\u306e\u7279\u6b8a\u306a\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u3069\u3093\u306a\u6a5f\u5668\u304c\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\uff1f</h2>\n<p>\u57fa\u672c\u7684\u306b\u3001\u901a\u5e38\u306e USB HID \u4e92\u63db\u5165\u529b\u6a5f...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/input.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:34:03+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "title": "Home", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![MiSTer-kun Cat by hewhoisred and MiSTer Logo by Conrad Fenech](assets/logo_small.png){ align=center width=\"750\" }\n  <figcaption>MiSTer-...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:32:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/videoscaling/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/videoscaling/", "title": "Video Scaling", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer has a built-in scaler that converts the cores' low-resolution video to a higher resolution, optionally using filters to improve the picture on modern ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/videoscaling.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:32:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/", "title": "\u30db\u30fc\u30e0", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![\u30df\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u304f\u3093\u732b\uff08\u4f5c\uff1ahewhoisred\uff09\u3068 MiSTer \u30ed\u30b4\uff08\u4f5c\uff1aConrad Fenech\uff09](assets/logo_small.png){ align=center width=\"750\" }\n  <figcaption>\u30df\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u304f\u3093\u732b\uff08\u4f5c\uff1ahewhoisre...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/index.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:32:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/videoscaling/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/videoscaling/", "title": "\u30d3\u30c7\u30aa\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u306f\u5185\u8535\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u304c\u3042\u308a\u3001\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u4f4e\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6\u6620\u50cf\u3092\u9ad8\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6\u306b\u5909\u63db\u3057\u3001\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3067\u30d5\u30a3\u30eb\u30bf\u30fc\u3092\u4f7f\u3063\u3066\u30e2\u30c0\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3067\u306e\u898b\u6804\u3048\u3092\u6539\u5584\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>Video Scale Mode\uff08vscale_mode\uff09</h2>\n<p>microSD \u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u76f4\u4e0b\u306e [...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/videoscaling.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:32:47+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/network/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/network/", "title": "Advanced Networking", "content_html": "<p>The MiSTer has several advanced networking features.</p>\n<h2>Network access</h2>\n<p>The MiSTer board can be accessed through the on-board Ethernet port. The system has *...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/network.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:32:14+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/network/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/network/", "title": "\u9ad8\u5ea6\u306a\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u306f\u9ad8\u5ea6\u306a\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u6a5f\u80fd\u304c\u3044\u304f\u3064\u304b\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9 { #network-access }</h2>\n<p>MiSTer \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u306f\u30aa\u30f3\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9 Ethernet \u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u7d4c\u7531\u3067\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002<strong>FTP</strong>\u3001<strong>SSH</strong>\u3001<strong>SFTP</strong> \u30b5\u30fc\u30d3\u30b9\u304c\u52d5\u3044\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002FTP \u306f\u8cc7\u683c\u60c5\u5831\u3068\u30c7\u30fc...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/network.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:32:14+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "title": "FAQ", "content_html": "<p>Answers to frequently asked questions about MiSTer. If something is missing, feel free to contribute by editing this page on GitHub with the Edit (pen) icon ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:31:23+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "title": "\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f\u3078\u306e\u56de\u7b54\u3067\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u304b\u4e0d\u8db3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308c\u3070\u3001\u53f3\u4e0a\u306e Edit\uff08\u30da\u30f3\uff09\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3\u304b\u3089 GitHub \u4e0a\u3067\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092\u7de8\u96c6\u3057\u3066\u8ca2\u732e\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<h2>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066</h2>\n<h3>MiSTer \u306e\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u306f\u96e3\u3057\u3044\uff1f \u672c\u5f53\u306b\u3044\u3058\u304f\u308a\u56de\u3059\u306e\u304c\u597d\u304d\u306a\u6280\u8853\u8005\u5411\u3051\u306a\u306e\uff1f</h3>\n<p>\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3001\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3002\u3044\u3058...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:31:23+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/midi/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/midi/", "title": "MIDI Features", "content_html": "<p>There are multiple options for using MIDI on the MiSTer.</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/dwhinham/mt32-pi/wiki\">The mt32-pi Project</a>{target=_blank}</h2>\n<p>Dale Whinham (a...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/midi.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/nativeres/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/nativeres/", "title": "Historical Core Resolutions", "content_html": "<p>This chart shows each core's default native resolution, frequencies, and pixel clock at startup. These values are not static and are documented for reference...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/nativeres.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/addons/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/addons/", "title": "Add-on Boards", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![MiSTer FPGA Sandwich Punk Style Art by hewhoisred](img/misterpunk.png){ align=center width=\"400\" }\n  <figcaption>Artwork by Hewhoisred<...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/addons.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/console/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/console/", "title": "Console Cores", "content_html": "<p>This is a list of the console cores in the MiSTer GitHub repository. Boot ROM filenames and their meaning differ per core \u2014 check each core's README. (In the...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/console.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:26:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}